      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2694,
      "text": "And there is certainly a lesson for you in livestock animals. We provide you with a drink out of what they have in their bellies, and for you there are many benefits in them, and from their [meat] you eat,",
