      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2696,
      "text": "We sent Noah to his people. He said, “O my people, worship Allah; you have no god other than Him. Will you not then fear Him?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 343,
      "ruku": 296,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2697,
      "text": "The disbelieving chiefs of his people said, “This is only a man like yourselves who wants to be superior to you. If Allah had willed, He could have sent down angels. We have not heard such a thing from our forefathers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 343,
      "ruku": 296,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2698,
      "text": "He is just a madman, so bear with him for a while[7].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
